<section class="ex-note" id="def">
<h2>1. Definition &amp; Overview（定義與概觀）</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Linear IgA dermatosis（LAD，linear IgA bullous dermatosis）</strong>：rare、immune-mediated 水疱病，定義是 cutaneous basement membrane 有 <strong>homogeneous linear deposits of IgA</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.992</span></li>
<li>最初被視為 dermatitis herpetiformis（DH）的一種表現，現已依 immunopathology、immunogenetics，以及缺乏與 gluten-sensitive enteropathy 的一致關聯，明確與 DH 區分。<span class="ex-ref">p.992</span></li>
<li>臨床可表現得像 EBA、DH、bullous pemphigoid（BP）、lichen planus、prurigo nodularis 或 cicatricial pemphigoid。<span class="ex-ref">p.992</span></li>
<li><strong>Chronic bullous disease of childhood（CBDC）</strong>：rare，主要發生在 <strong class="ex-n">&lt;5 歲</strong>兒童，表皮基底膜有相同的 homogeneous linear IgA deposits；研究顯示 in some patients CBDC 與 LAD 是同一疾病的不同表現。<span class="ex-ref">p.992</span></li>
<li><strong>Drug-induced linear IgA</strong>：最初以 vancomycin 描述，現已與多種藥物相關；臨床表現與 classic LAD 略有不同（differs somewhat），表現更多樣，包括 morbilliform、erythema multiforme–like、toxic epidermal necrolysis–like。<span class="ex-ref">p.992</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="epi">
<h2>2. Epidemiology &amp; HLA（流行病學與 HLA）</h2>
<ul>
<li>LAD most often after puberty，<strong>most patients presenting after the fourth decade of life</strong>（多數在 fourth decade 之後發病）。<span class="ex-ref">p.992</span></li>
<li>Several studies 見 slight female predominance，但也有研究結果相反。<span class="ex-ref">p.992–993</span></li>
<li>CBDC most often before the age of <strong class="ex-n">5 years</strong>；several（but not all）studies 也見 slight female predominance。<span class="ex-ref">p.993</span></li>
<li>Table 58-4 註：單一中心 <strong class="ex-n">28</strong> 位病人的 cohort，drug-induced 發病年齡中位數 <strong class="ex-n">75 歲</strong>，spontaneous LAD 為 <strong class="ex-n">44.5 歲</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.998</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>HLA association（結果不一致）</h3>
<ul>
<li>LAD：some investigators 發現 HLA-B8 頻率增加，others 沒有。<span class="ex-ref">p.993</span></li>
<li>CBDC：HLA-B8 頻率增加，up to <strong class="ex-n">76%</strong> 病人表現 HLA-B8。<span class="ex-ref">p.993</span></li>
<li>Collier et al：CBDC 有 HLA-B8、HLA-DR3、HLA-DQ2 增加，成人 LAD 沒有；作者認為這些 haplotypes may 與較早發病有關。<span class="ex-ref">p.993</span></li>
<li><em>TNF2</em> allele 在成人與兒童 linear IgA disease 都比 unaffected subjects 增加，但與 HLA-DR3+ controls 相比則無增加。<span class="ex-ref">p.993</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>McKee 補充</h3>
<ul>
<li>Incidence：south of England 約 <strong class="ex-n">1 : 250 000</strong>；France 與 central Germany <strong class="ex-n">0.5 per million</strong>；Singapore <strong class="ex-n">0.26 per million</strong>；Utah <strong class="ex-n">0.6 per 100 000</strong>；some consider underdiagnosed。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.167</span></li>
<li>成人 LAD <strong>affects the sexes equally</strong>；年齡分布廣，peaks in teenagers and young adults 與 sixties。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.167</span></li>
<li>Childhood LAD：F:M <strong class="ex-n">1.6 : 1</strong>；average age of onset <strong class="ex-n">6 years</strong>，very rare neonatal cases。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.167</span></li>
<li>HLA-Cw7、-B8、-DR2、-DR3、-DQ2 表現增加；HLA-B8 報告比例 <strong class="ex-n">28%–56%</strong>（normal range 20–25%）；no evidence of HLA-B12 增加。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.167</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="immunopathology">
<h2>3. Etiology &amp; Pathogenesis: Immunopathology（免疫病理）</h2>
<h3>Cutaneous deposits（DIF）</h3>
<ul>
<li>LAD 與 CBDC 都以 dermal–epidermal BMZ 的 <strong>homogeneous linear band of IgA</strong> 定義。<span class="ex-ref">p.993</span></li>
<li>A minority 另有其他 immunoreactants：most often IgG，occasionally C3。<span class="ex-ref">p.993</span></li>
<li>一項回溯研究：idiopathic LAD <strong class="ex-n">40%</strong> 有 C3，但成人 drug-induced LAD 沒有任何一例有 C3。<span class="ex-ref">p.993</span></li>
<li>皮膚中的 IgA 幾乎全是 <strong>IgA1</strong>，不是黏膜常見的 IgA2；也沒有 secretory piece 或 J chain → 有人據此認為不是 mucosal origin，但 true origin 仍不清楚。<span class="ex-ref">p.993</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Circulating antibodies（循環抗體）</h3>
<ul>
<li>以 <strong>1 M NaCl-split</strong> normal human skin 做 IIF：the majority of CBDC 有 <strong>low-titer</strong> 抗體結合 <strong>epidermal side</strong>；成人 LAD 也找到 low-titer IgA。<span class="ex-ref">p.993</span></li>
<li>Some patients 的 IgA 結合 dermal side → 提示 more than 1 antigen 可能是標的。<span class="ex-ref">p.993</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Immunoelectron microscopy（3 種沉積型態）</h3>
<ul>
<li>LAD：(1) lamina lucida（BP-like）；(2) at and below the lamina densa（EBA-like）；(3) above and below the lamina densa（Prost et al）。<span class="ex-ref">p.994</span></li>
<li>CBDC：lamina lucida 或 sublamina densa。<span class="ex-ref">p.994</span></li>
<li>Horiguchi et al（日本 <strong class="ex-n">213</strong> 例）：發病年齡較大與 IgG/IgA type 及 dermal binding 強烈相關；IgG 見於 infantile（CBDC）約 <strong class="ex-n">9%</strong>、adults（&gt;16 歲）<strong class="ex-n">24%</strong>；依 antigen binding 分組並無顯著臨床差異。<span class="ex-ref">p.994</span></li>
</ul>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Composition of cutaneous immunoreactants</th><th scope="col">Location of immunoreactants</th><th scope="col">Circulating IgA autoantibodies</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Linear IgA</td><td><strong class="ex-n">40%</strong> have C3；<strong class="ex-n">24%</strong> have IgG；almost all IgA1</td><td>1. Lamina lucida（BP-like）<br>2. At and below lamina lucida（EBA-like）<br>3. Above and below lamina lucida</td><td>May have low titer against epidermal basement membrane antigens</td></tr>
<tr><td>Drug-induced IgA</td><td>None reported with C3；almost all have IgA1</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr>
<tr><td>CBDC</td><td><strong class="ex-n">9%</strong> have IgG；may have C3；almost all have IgA1</td><td>Lamina lucida or sublamina densa</td><td>Most have low titer against epidermal side of sodium split-skin</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 58-1，p.993。表格第 2、3 型寫「lamina lucida」，p.994 內文則寫「at and below the lamina densa」「above and below the lamina densa」。</p>
<h3>Target antigens（標的抗原）</h3>
<ul>
<li>Zone et al：CBDC 與 LAD 的 serum IgA 結合 <strong>97-kDa</strong> protein，位於 lamina lucida、hemidesmosome 下方；後證實它是 <strong>180-kDa BP antigen（BPAG2，collagen XVII）</strong> extracellular domain 的一部分。<span class="ex-ref">p.994</span></li>
<li>BPAG2 由 180-kDa transmembrane protein 與 120-kDa collagenous ectodomain 構成；LAD 自體抗體辨認 soluble <strong>120-kDa ectodomain</strong>，但此標的並非 LAD 獨有（some CP 與 BP 病人也有）。<span class="ex-ref">p.994</span></li>
<li>LAD 的 IgA 抗體與 T cells 針對 collagen XVII 的 <strong>NC16A</strong> region，與 BP 的 IgG 與 T cells 相同 → may 部分解釋臨床與組織學重疊。<span class="ex-ref">p.994</span></li>
<li>Wojnarowska et al：some patients 的 IgA 結合 <strong>285-kDa protein（LAD 285）</strong>，不是 230-kDa BP antigen，也不是 type VII collagen。<span class="ex-ref">p.994</span></li>
<li>Allen &amp; Wojnarowska（&gt;70 位 LAD 與 CBDC）：predominant antigenic target 是 <strong>BP180（collagen XVII）</strong>，some patients 對 BP230、LAD 285 等多種抗原反應。<span class="ex-ref">p.994</span></li>
<li>其他：anti–laminin-332（一例 linear IgA/IgG bullous dermatosis）；sublamina densa 型 DIF 的 12 例中有 8 例 type VII collagen appeared to be 標的。<span class="ex-ref">p.994</span></li>
<li>In many patients IgA 似乎（appears to）結合多個抗原 → 提示可能有 epitope spreading，但臨床意義尚未確立。<span class="ex-ref">p.994</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="clinical">
<h2>4. Clinical Findings（臨床表現）</h2>
<h3>Adult linear IgA dermatosis（成人 LAD）</h3>
<ul>
<li>Heterogeneous，<strong>often indistinguishable from DH</strong>：病人可（may）以 annular 或 grouped papules、vesicles、bullae 的組合表現。<span class="ex-ref">p.994–995</span></li>
<li>Typically 對稱分布於 <strong>extensor surfaces</strong>：elbows、knees、buttocks。<span class="ex-ref">p.995</span></li>
<li>Most often very pruritic → 大量 crusted papules；但 pruritus 程度 variable，<strong>in general less severe than DH</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.995</span></li>
<li>Some patients 出現較大 bullae（BP-like），occasionally 類似 EBA。<span class="ex-ref">p.995</span></li>
<li>Rarely 以 acute febrile illness 合併 arthritis、arthralgias、generalized malaise 表現 → 曾被當成全身感染評估；DIF 有 linear IgA，對常規治療有反應。<span class="ex-ref">p.995–996</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Chronic bullous disease of childhood（CBDC）</h3>
<ul>
<li>Most often 為 <strong>tense bullae</strong>，often 在 inflammatory base 上。<span class="ex-ref">p.995</span></li>
<li>Most frequently 在 <strong>perineum 與 perioral region</strong>；often 可（may）成群出現，呈 <strong>「cluster of jewels」</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.995</span></li>
<li>新病灶 sometimes 出現在舊病灶周圍，形成 <strong>「collarette」of blisters</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.995</span></li>
<li>Often 有明顯 pruritus 和／或 burning；often 急性出現大量 tense blisters，may 破裂並續發感染。<span class="ex-ref">p.995</span></li>
<li>與成人 LAD 的差別：典型臨床外觀、relative paucity of serious mucosal involvement、good prognosis。<span class="ex-ref">p.995</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>McKee 補充</h3>
<ul>
<li>成人 LAD may 像 DH 或 more commonly 像 BP；occasionally 初期像 erythema multiforme；pruritus 和／或 burning 常見。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.167</span></li>
<li>Blisters arising at the edge of erythematous annular lesions（<strong>「string of beads」sign</strong>）said to be characteristic。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.167</span></li>
<li>Very rarely 以 TEN 樣大片脫皮表現，這種型態 generally 代表 drug-induced LAD。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.167</span></li>
<li>部位依頻率遞減：trunk、limbs、hands、scalp、face、perioral region；perineum 與 vagina 也可能受侵犯。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.167</span></li>
<li>Childhood LAD not uncommonly 發生在上呼吸道疾病之後，often 在 penicillin 治療後；病灶 usually 在正常皮膚上，usually 新病灶出現在消退病灶周圍（cluster of jewels sign）。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.167</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="mucosal">
<h2>5. Mucosal Involvement（黏膜侵犯）</h2>
<ul>
<li><mark data-q="103-14">Mucosal involvement 是 LAD 與 CBDC <strong>重要的臨床表現</strong>：從 largely asymptomatic oral ulcerations／erosions、單獨嚴重口腔病，到類似 cicatricial pemphigoid 的嚴重 conjunctival 與 oral disease</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.996</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="103-14">Oral lesions may occur in up to <strong class="ex-n">70%</strong> of patients with linear IgA disease</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.996</span></li>
<li>Mucosal invasion with complication 在 CBDC 較少見。<span class="ex-ref">p.996</span></li>
<li>多數有黏膜侵犯者也有明顯皮膚病灶，但有以黏膜為首發與主要表現的報告；這些病人可能（may）表現為 desquamative gingivitis、類似 CP 的口腔病灶，以及 conjunctival disease 與 scar formation（Chap. 55 mucous membrane／cicatricial pemphigoid，<span class="ex-ref">p.960（ch55）</span>）。<span class="ex-ref">p.996</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="102-30">Mucosal involvement also appears to be <strong>less prominent</strong> in patients with <strong>drug-induced linear IgA</strong></mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.996</span></li>
<li>也有在典型皮膚表現出現前，先有嚴重 laryngeal 與 pharyngeal involvement 的報告。<span class="ex-ref">p.996</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>Table 58-4：drug-induced LAD「Mucosal involvement less prominent than with linear IgA dermatosis」；CBDC「Mucosal involvement noted, but less commonly than in linear IgA dermatosis」。<span class="ex-ref">p.998</span> ch45 也寫 drug-induced 型 may 與 idiopathic 不同，其中之一是 mucosal or conjunctival lesions 較不常見。<span class="ex-ref">p.753（ch45）</span></aside>
<h3>McKee 補充</h3>
<ul>
<li>成人 LAD mucous membrane involvement <strong>is common</strong>，因可留疤而特別重要：eyes（conjunctivitis、symblepharon、trichiasis、corneal opacification、rarely blindness）、mouth（erosions、blisters、chronic ulceration）、nasal cavity、pharynx（hoarseness）；嚴重時與 mucous membrane pemphigoid 臨床重疊。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.167</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="103-14">Childhood LAD：mucous membrane lesions are common（<strong class="ex-n">64%</strong>）</mark>；ocular symptoms <strong class="ex-n">40%</strong>；conjunctival scarring approximately <strong class="ex-n">21%</strong>；oral lesions up to <strong class="ex-n">57%</strong>。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.167</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="drug">
<h2>6. Drug-Induced Linear IgA Dermatosis（藥物引起的 LAD）</h2>
<ul>
<li><mark data-q="113-13">Vancomycin is the <strong>most common drug</strong> associated with linear IgA bullous dermatosis</mark>；且 LAD 是 vancomycin 最常見的 nonimmediate hypersensitivity reaction。<span class="ex-ref">p.997</span></li>
<li>其他藥物：lithium、phenytoin、sulfamethoxazole-trimethoprim、furosemide、atorvastatin、captopril、diclofenac、ketoprofen、infliximab；interferon-α2a 與 influenza vaccine 也有報告（皆 self-limited，不同於 classic LAD 的 chronic waxing-and-waning course）。<span class="ex-ref">p.995、p.997</span></li>
<li>表現：relatively acute onset；erythema multiforme–like、TEN-like（widespread bullae）；localized palmar 與 morbilliform variants；Koebner phenomenon 也有報告。<span class="ex-ref">p.995、p.997</span></li>
<li>Acute contact dermatitis 背景下的 localized linear IgA 也有報告。<span class="ex-ref">p.995</span></li>
<li>Small number of vancomycin-induced 病例有循環 IgA 抗 BP180、BP230、LAD 285；機轉不明。<span class="ex-ref">p.997</span></li>
<li>一例 vancomycin-induced LAD 以漸進方式 rechallenge 並未復發；一例以 drug-induced lymphocyte stimulation test 成功找出致病藥（尚待更廣泛研究）。<span class="ex-ref">p.997</span></li>
<li>治療：單純停藥即有恢復的報告，但 may benefit from dapsone。<span class="ex-ref">p.995</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Fitzpatrick ch45 補充</h3>
<ul>
<li>Drug-induced 型 may 與 idiopathic 不同：<mark data-q="102-30">mucosal or conjunctival lesions 較少</mark>、停藥後 spontaneous remission、病灶消退後 immune deposits 消失；may 較常以類似 TEN 的 erosions 表現，病程較嚴重、有 sepsis 與 shock 風險。Time to onset 報告為 <strong class="ex-n">2 days 到 4 weeks</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.753（ch45）</span></li>
<li>Sporadic LAD <strong class="ex-n">13%–30%</strong> 有循環 BMZ 抗體，drug-induced 病例則未見報告；DIF 只有 IgA、沒有 IgG 時，應提高懷疑藥物引起。<span class="ex-ref">p.753（ch45）</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>McKee 補充</h3>
<ul>
<li>Most often associated with <strong>intravenous vancomycin</strong>；其他包括 trimethoprim-sulfamethoxazole、penicillin、phenytoin、lithium、amiodarone、captopril、ceftriaxone、IFN-alpha、amoxicillin、diclofenac、ketoprofen、infliximab、ustekinumab、HPV vaccination 等。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.651</span></li>
<li>Vancomycin-induced 病灶 predilection for trunk、extremities、palms、soles；mucosal involvement up to <strong class="ex-n">40%</strong>；因此可能與 EM、TEN 有 considerable clinical overlap；drug-induced LAD tends to be more severe than spontaneous forms。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.651</span></li>
<li>DIF 依定義都有 linear IgA；C3 approximately <strong class="ex-n">20%</strong>；linear IgG very exceptionally。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.651–652</span></li>
<li>Circulating IgA anti-BMZ 抗體 <strong class="ex-n">25%</strong>；split skin predominantly 定位在 floor of the blister cavity。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.652</span></li>
<li>Histologically majority 為 neutrophil-rich subepidermal blister，sometimes eosinophils conspicuous。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.652</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>Drug-induced LAD 的 C3：Fitzpatrick 寫成人 drug-induced 病例無 C3（<span class="ex-ref">p.993</span>），McKee 寫約 20% 有 C3（<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.651</span>）。循環抗體：Fitzpatrick 寫 drug-induced 病例未見報告（<span class="ex-ref">p.753（ch45）</span>），McKee 寫 25%（<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.652</span>）。</aside>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="associations">
<h2>7. Disease Associations（相關疾病）</h2>
<h3>Gluten-sensitive enteropathy（GSE）</h3>
<ul>
<li>Some investigators 見小腸 minimal inflammatory changes，但 numerous investigators 無法證明多數病人有 DH 特徵的 villous atrophy。<span class="ex-ref">p.996–997</span></li>
<li>Gluten-free diet 無法控制 LAD；多數 LAD 病人沒有 anti–tissue transglutaminase 抗體。<span class="ex-ref">p.997</span></li>
<li>At-a-glance：may 與 inflammatory bowel diseases 相關，但 only rarely 與 GSE 相關。<span class="ex-ref">p.992</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Inflammatory bowel disease</h3>
<ul>
<li>Ulcerative colitis 與 Crohn disease：兩病活性 can 連動（一個 flare，另一個也 flare）。<span class="ex-ref">p.997</span></li>
<li>Paige et al：70 位 LAD 中 <strong class="ex-n">5 位（7.1%）</strong>合併 UC；UC 的 abnormal mucosal IgA1 production perhaps 有關。一例 UC 病人在 infliximab 治療後才發生 LAD。<span class="ex-ref">p.997</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Malignancy（惡性腫瘤）</h3>
<ul>
<li><mark data-q="108-04">Linear IgA disease also has been associated <strong>rarely</strong> with a variety of malignancies，包括 <strong>lymphoid</strong> 與 nonlymphoid malignancies</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.997</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="108-04">An unusual urticarial form of linear IgA with oral lesions 曾作為 <strong>chronic lymphocytic leukemia（CLL）</strong>的首發表現</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.997</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="108-04">Godfrey et al：70 位 LAD 平均追蹤 <strong class="ex-n">8.5 years</strong>，有 <strong class="ex-n">3</strong> 例 lymphoid malignancy（年齡性別配對預期 <strong class="ex-n">0.2</strong> 例）；nonlymphoid malignancy 未增加 → suggest a small risk of lymphoid malignancy</mark>，仍需更大型 population-based studies 確認。<span class="ex-ref">p.997</span></li>
<li>At-a-glance：<mark data-q="108-04">Rarely seen in association with malignancy, specifically lymphoid malignancy</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.992</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Others（其他）</h3>
<ul>
<li>CBDC：Horiguchi 213 例中只有 <strong class="ex-n">13</strong> 例有相關全身疾病；曾報告與 acute mononucleosis，以及 chronic granulomatous disease 背景下的 <em>Paecilomyces</em> lung infection 相關，關係尚未確立。<span class="ex-ref">p.997</span></li>
<li>Physical triggers：rarely，<strong>ultraviolet light</strong> 為主；也有與 varicella zoster 相關的報告。<span class="ex-ref">p.997</span></li>
<li>侷限於皮膚黏膜是常規，但有 a few cases 合併 <strong>IgA nephropathy</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.997</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>McKee 補充</h3>
<ul>
<li>早期文獻認為 as many as <strong class="ex-n">24%</strong> 合併 GSE，但 incidence is almost certainly considerably lower。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.167</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="108-04">A number of reports 記錄 LAD 與 internal malignancy 相關，包括 lymphoma、leukemia、solid organ carcinomas、sarcomas，但是否有意義 uncertain</mark>。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.168</span></li>
<li>其他相關：inflammatory bowel disease（in particular UC）、infections、Sjögren syndrome、HPV vaccination、drugs；exceptionally 可由 ultraviolet B 誘發。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.168</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="histo">
<h2>8. Histopathology（病理）</h2>
<ul>
<li>Early lesion：<strong>subepidermal bulla</strong>，neutrophils 沿 basement membrane 聚集，often 堆積於 <strong>papillary tips</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.997</span></li>
<li>Superficial dermal vessels 周圍 may 有 mild lymphocytic infiltrate，沒有 neutrophilic vasculitis。<span class="ex-ref">p.997</span></li>
<li>Occasionally 浸潤以 eosinophils 為主，但 most frequently 以 neutrophils 為主。<span class="ex-ref">p.997</span></li>
<li>EM：水疱形成於 lamina lucida 內或 sublamina densa。<span class="ex-ref">p.997</span></li>
<li>Usually 難與 DH 區分：Smith et al 認為 LAD tended to 有較少 papillary microabscesses、BMZ 有較 diffuse 的 neutrophils；Blenkinsopp et al 則找不到顯著差異。In general，LAD、CBDC、DH 的病理 virtually indistinguishable。<span class="ex-ref">p.997–998</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>McKee 補充（Histology &amp; Immunofluorescence）</h3>
<ul>
<li>Most frequently 呈 DH-like 特徵；occasionally 像 BP，sometimes 兩者混合；eosinophilic spongiosis may rarely be a feature。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.168</span></li>
<li>Ultrastructural cleavage may 位於 lamina lucida 或 below the lamina densa。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.168</span></li>
<li>DIF：homogeneous linear IgA 見於 <strong class="ex-n">100%</strong> 病人；uninvolved skin（particularly of the back）適合；oral mucosa 與 conjunctiva may 也有 IgA 沉積。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.168</span></li>
<li>Linear IgA antigen 存在於所有 stratified squamous epithelia 與 amnion，但與 BP antigen 不同，<strong>不存在於 bladder mucosa</strong>。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.168</span></li>
<li>IgG may 見於 up to <strong class="ex-n">25%</strong>；IgM 與 C3 occasionally。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.168</span></li>
<li>Low titer circulating IgA anti-BMZ 抗體 approximately <strong class="ex-n">30%</strong>；以 conjunctiva 為 substrate may 提高到 up to <strong class="ex-n">50%</strong>；blister fluid 也可做 IIMF。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.168</span></li>
<li>Split skin IIF：IgA 可標記 epidermal side、dermal side 或兩側。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.168</span></li>
<li>Western immunoblotting：dermal binding 抗原包括 285-kD、250-kD 與 type VII collagen；epidermal binding 抗原包括 BP230、BP180 與 200/280-kD 抗原；120 kD（LAD1）與 97 kD 是 BP180 的 proteolytic cleavage products。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.169</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="ddx">
<h2>9. Differential Diagnosis（鑑別診斷）</h2>
<ul>
<li>LAD often closely mimics DH；some patients may 有類似 BP、cicatricial pemphigoid、EBA，rarely 類似 TEN 的表現。<span class="ex-ref">p.998</span></li>
<li>CBDC 須與 childhood DH 及 childhood BP 區分。<span class="ex-ref">p.998</span></li>
<li>DIF 見 BMZ <strong>linear IgA</strong>，most often 沒有 IgG 與 C3 → 可與 BP、CP、EBA 區分；DH 則是 BMZ <strong>granular IgA</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.998</span></li>
</ul>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Table 58-3 Linear IgA bullous dermatosis differential diagnosis</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Dermatitis herpetiformis</td></tr>
<tr><td>Bullous pemphigoid</td></tr>
<tr><td>Epidermolysis bullosa acquisita</td></tr>
<tr><td>Bullous eruption of systemic lupus erythematosus</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cicatricial pemphigoid</td></tr>
<tr><td>Lichen planus</td></tr>
<tr><td>Toxic epidermal necrolysis</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 58-3，p.998。McKee 列出須鑑別的是 DH、BP 與 inflammatory epidermolysis bullosa（Table 4.6），McKee p.170。</p>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>LAD most often 對 dapsone 或 sulfapyridine 有 dramatic response，usually 在 24–48 小時內出現，與 DH 相似；因此此反應 <strong>not a helpful diagnostic sign</strong> for LAD。<span class="ex-ref">p.999</span></aside>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="comparison">
<h2>10. Clinical Comparison（LAD、drug-induced、CBDC 比較）</h2>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Item</th><th scope="col">Linear IgA dermatosis</th><th scope="col">Drug-induced linear IgA</th><th scope="col">CBDC</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Epidemiology</td><td>Often adults at the 4th decade of life；slight female predominance</td><td>Adults（median age 75 vs 44.5，見註）</td><td>Occurs before 5 years of age；slight female predominance</td></tr>
<tr><td>Clinical presentation</td><td>Similar to DH；annular or grouped papules、vesicles、bullae on extensors（elbows、knees、buttocks）；pruritus less severe than in DH</td><td>Vary from EM-like to TEN-like with widespread bullae；Koebner phenomenon may be present</td><td>Tense bullae in a「cluster-of-jewels」appearance；collarette of blisters may be present</td></tr>
<tr><td>Mucosal involvement</td><td><mark data-q="103-14">Oral involvement in up to 70%</mark></td><td><mark data-q="102-30">Less prominent than with linear IgA dermatosis</mark></td><td>Noted, but less commonly than in linear IgA dermatosis</td></tr>
<tr><td>Disease associations &amp; triggers</td><td>Possible association with ulcerative colitis；UV light is the chief physical trigger</td><td><mark data-q="113-13">Vancomycin most commonly implicated</mark>；IFN-α、influenza vaccine、lithium、phenytoin、TMP-SMX、furosemide、atorvastatin、captopril、diclofenac、ketoprofen、infliximab</td><td>Possible association with infectious mononucleosis 與 CGD 背景下的 <em>Paecilomyces</em> lung infection</td></tr>
<tr><td>Course</td><td>Unpredictable；從 spontaneous remission 到 longstanding disease</td><td>Rechallenge of drug may not result in recurrence</td><td>Self-limited；remission within <strong class="ex-n">2 years</strong> of onset</td></tr>
<tr><td>Treatment</td><td>Dapsone、sulfapyridine（response within <strong class="ex-n">24–48 h</strong>）；low-dose prednisone may suppress blister formation</td><td>Discontinuation of causative drug；sometimes dapsone is helpful</td><td>Dapsone、sulfapyridine；small doses of prednisone may be of use；MMF as steroid-sparing agent；topical tacrolimus</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 58-4，p.998（已對照原頁）。註：單中心 28 位病人 cohort，drug-induced 發病年齡中位數 75 歲、spontaneous 44.5 歲。</p>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="treatment">
<h2>11. Treatment &amp; Prognosis（治療與預後）</h2>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Line（順位）</th><th scope="col">Pharmacological treatments（藥物）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>First-line</td><td>Dapsone；sulfapyridine</td></tr>
<tr><td>First-line adjuvant</td><td>Low-dose prednisone</td></tr>
<tr><td>Second-line</td><td>Mycophenolate mofetil；intravenous immunoglobulin</td></tr>
<tr><td>Second-line adjuvant</td><td>Antibiotics（trimethoprim-sulfamethoxazole、dicloxacillin、erythromycin、flucloxacillin）；topical tacrolimus</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 58-2，p.994（已對照原頁）。</p>
<h3>Adult LAD（成人）</h3>
<ul>
<li>Course unpredictable：many patients 持續多年，few, if any, remissions；occasionally spontaneous remission，皮膚 linear IgA deposits 也消失。<span class="ex-ref">p.998–999</span></li>
<li>嚴重黏膜病（尤其眼睛）may 在水疱緩解後仍持續有 symblepharon 與眼瞼、角膜結構問題；<strong>untreated ocular involvement can lead to cicatrix and loss of vision</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.999</span></li>
<li>Most often 對 <strong>dapsone 或 sulfapyridine</strong> dramatic response，usually 在 <strong class="ex-n">24–48 hours</strong> 內（與 DH 相似）。<span class="ex-ref">p.999</span></li>
<li>Most patients 單用 dapsone 或 sulfapyridine 即可控制；some patients 需 low-dose prednisone 抑制水疱。<span class="ex-ref">p.999</span></li>
<li>Unresponsive 或 intolerant 者，mycophenolate mofetil 可作 steroid-sparing agent；TMP-SMX 與其他 immunosuppressives 併用時 reported to be helpful。<span class="ex-ref">p.999</span></li>
<li>The majority 無法以 gluten-free diet 控制皮膚病。<span class="ex-ref">p.999</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>CBDC（兒童）</h3>
<ul>
<li>Most often self-limited，most children 在發病 <strong class="ex-n">2 years</strong> 內緩解；occasionally 持續到 puberty，但 often 較初次發作輕微。<span class="ex-ref">p.999</span></li>
<li>對 dapsone 或 sulfapyridine 同樣 dramatic response；many children 需加 relatively small doses of prednisone。<span class="ex-ref">p.999</span></li>
<li>MMF 用於 isolated cases；IVIG 曾被提議用於 rare 對 dapsone 無效或不耐受者；topical tacrolimus may 減少全身治療。<span class="ex-ref">p.999</span></li>
<li>Several case reports 提示（suggest）some patients may 對 antibiotics（sulfonamides、dicloxacillin、erythromycin）有反應；一個 case series 中 <strong class="ex-n">7</strong> 位兒童以 flucloxacillin 治療改善，<strong class="ex-n">4</strong> 位在 <strong class="ex-n">3 months</strong> 內緩解，但不能排除 spontaneous remission。<span class="ex-ref">p.999</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>McKee 補充</h3>
<ul>
<li>成人 LAD 為 sometimes self-remitting、dapsone 或 sulfonamide-responsive 的皮膚病。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.167</span></li>
<li>Childhood LAD 原以為 self-limiting，現知症狀 may 持續超過 5 年（<strong class="ex-n">25%</strong>），occasionally 延續到成年；exceptionally 合併 IgA nephropathy。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.167</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>CBDC 的 HLA-B8：Fitzpatrick 寫 up to 76%（<span class="ex-ref">p.993</span>），McKee 寫 LAD 的 HLA-B8 報告比例 28%–56%（<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.167</span>）。成人 LAD 性別：Fitzpatrick 寫 several studies 有 slight female predominance（<span class="ex-ref">p.992</span>），McKee 寫 affects the sexes equally（<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.167</span>）。</aside>
</section>
